PROCEDURE:

1. Create your maven project in GitHub

2. Login to your OCI account

3. Navigate to Menu -> Developer Services > DevOps

4. Create DevOps project

5. Create the External connection (GitHub)

6. Mirror your maven repository

7. Create "build_spec.yaml" file

8. Click and create build pipeline

9. Next Click Add Stage -> Managed Build

10. Run Pipeline by clicking Start Manual Run

11. Verify your output




CODE:

build_spec.yaml

version: 0.1

component: build

steps:

- type: Command

name: Install Dependencies
command: |

mvn clean install -DskipTests

- type: Command

name: Regression Testing

command: |

mvn test

- type: Command

name: Package

command: |

mvn package
